        "biography": "David Malinowski\u00a0is a BAFTA and Oscar-winning\u00a0special effects makeup\u00a0artist.\u00a0He started his career in 1996 and spent 10 years working for\u00a0Madame Tussauds\u00a0in London, then left to pursue his career in film and television. At the 2018\u00a0BAFTA Film Awards, he won the \u00a0Film Makeup and Hair award. At the\u00a090th Academy Awards, he won the Best Makeup and Hairstyling\u00a0award for his work on the 2017 film\u00a0Darkest Hour.\u00a0He was nominated with\u00a0Kazuhiro Tsuji\u00a0and\u00a0Lucy Sibbick. He lives in the Buckinghamshire village of\u00a0Aston Clinton.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article David Malinowski, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.",
